                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                        "entry_id": "5e17b738-a319-3423-9975-62875e0c1985",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To introduce again."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66dbcbe4-8176-4ea7-9317-35e871caba7b",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "Cheap mid-week return tickets were reintroduced by British Railways on May 7, to encourage holiday travel during the week rather than at weekends."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9a14e0bc-df35-41dc-a1f1-9521d5af3adb",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "Pretend it never happened. The insurance business is completely screwy now. You know they’ve reintroduced the death penalty for insurance company directors?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5111265b-5dbe-4d9e-90f4-d0b55258a660",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "[…] whereas, were the masters to reintroduce slavery, both sides would return to the prebargain state, which would fall within the frontier and, therefore, would be inefficient."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae484de5-c27e-463e-aadd-6897b5d2c66f",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "It features equal-sized spoked hickory wheels, pneumatic tires, a chain drive, and an elliptical chain ring, something Japanese manufacturers reintroduced on bicycles in the late 1970s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbad4cd9-d748-43ae-8945-3032a3bb076b",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "The present chapter reintroduces CL in a more compact and less technical way, being written in a semitutorial style with a wider computer science audience in mind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "59f4ed61-7ff5-448e-b25e-b0c679e222fa",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "Slums like Dharavi are reintroducing this classic model of social commerce at an entirely new scale. Members of savings groups build assets individually and collectively, forming relationships of trust with their neighbors in the process."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7461b214-9154-41d5-bdab-ef265d965102",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "“Earth Two,” a new series by writer James Robinson and artist Nicola Scott, reintroduces the concept by putting a new spin on the original versions of characters like the Green Lantern, the Flash and Superman that diverges notably from the past several decades of DC lore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5268740c-c0e0-457b-8902-f4a51ff7aafc",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "Sweden has moved to reintroduce conscription “as a response to the new security situation” in Europe, the country’s defense minister told CNN Thursday."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d3b9654-77a5-4e8b-9d18-66d4414d1d4f",
                                "sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
                                "text": "SWR has decided to withdraw it with immediate effect and cease the programme of modifications that were under way, to avoid incurring further costs to the taxpayer to reintroduce and operate these trains."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45d502c6-fe3c-4f7b-8694-c2c634e5bc46",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e17b738-a319-3423-9975-62875e0c1985",
                        "source_sense_id": "1e170325-664f-3fb2-b476-8ef361556073",
